[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3 uid="uid://bq1roboteer0004"]

; One fight's 3D world, rebuilt from scratch for every fight (docs/stage3-rules-notes.md).
; own_world_3d gives each fight its own World3D and therefore its own physics space, so no
; fight ever inherits the space a previous fight dirtied. Arena, CameraRig and FX are
; placeholders that fight.gd replaces with the real scenes when their owners have landed
; them; Bots and Debris are R's own, and `Debris` must keep that name (agent P reparents
; detached parts into it).

